WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:05.317
Good day, and welcome to CourtZ. It helps
you set up fair and balanced games for

00:00:05.317 --> 00:00:09.078
your club. Let's get four courts of
doubles underway.

00:00:10.051 --> 00:00:12.690
Pop in your club's name and email address.

00:00:17.838 --> 00:00:19.555
Tap Start Trial.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:27.395
First, we had best add a few players. Tap
the Players tab.

00:00:30.203 --> 00:00:35.354
Here is our empty roster. Tap the Add
Player icon to enter the first name.

00:00:38.509 --> 00:00:43.730
Our inaugural player is Asha Patel. Enter
her name in the name field,

00:00:45.244 --> 00:00:46.910
then choose Female.

00:00:48.086 --> 00:00:53.082
Set the skill level from zero to ten. I'll
leave Asha at one.

00:00:53.389 --> 00:00:56.590
Tap Add to save Asha to the player roster.

00:00:58.781 --> 00:01:03.061
Add the rest of your regulars the very
same way. You can reuse these exact

00:01:03.061 --> 00:01:05.657
players in future sessions too.

00:01:06.691 --> 00:01:12.067
Splendid. Let's create our first session.
Open the Sessions tab.

00:01:14.316 --> 00:01:18.483
Tap the plus beside Play Sessions to build
a reusable profile.

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:25.720
This one's for Mondays down at the sports
hall. I'll call it Monday Doubles, and

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:30.054
keep the defaults: four courts, doubles,
and balanced teams.

00:01:34.852 --> 00:01:38.574
Tap the Add Player icon to select the
regulars for this session.

00:01:42.143 --> 00:01:45.344
Tap the names to move them from Available
to Added.

00:01:50.457 --> 00:01:54.625
Once your list is ready, tap Done, then
save the profile.

00:01:59.221 --> 00:02:03.901
You can prepare your roster well ahead of
club night. Begin by tapping the session

00:02:03.901 --> 00:02:05.148
profile.

00:02:07.634 --> 00:02:11.261
Choose Prepare Attendance to mark who you
expect to attend.

00:02:14.192 --> 00:02:18.336
We are expecting everyone on this list, so
I'll tap Select All.

00:02:20.917 --> 00:02:27.107
Nina can only stay for three matches. Tap
the tick beside her name to set that up.

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:33.967
Use the plus to change Expected Games from
Any to three.

00:02:38.373 --> 00:02:40.928
Tap Save to keep Nina's setting.

00:02:43.092 --> 00:02:47.552
Now save the attendance list too. That
will spare you a job when everyone

00:02:47.552 --> 00:02:48.600
arrives.

00:02:51.019 --> 00:02:55.028
On the night, open Games and select your
saved profile.

00:02:58.917 --> 00:03:04.417
Grace can't make it, and Hugo is running
fashionably late. Tap their names to

00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:06.264
untick them for the moment.

00:03:10.134 --> 00:03:16.302
A new chap has turned up. His name is Sam,
and he isn't in our Players list. Not to

00:03:16.302 --> 00:03:21.015
worry, he can still play. Let's use the
Add Guest button.

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:26.323
Enter his details and tap Add.

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:38.563
Sam is checked in. Once everyone present
is ticked, tap Start Session for the

00:03:38.563 --> 00:03:39.818
opening round.

00:03:46.757 --> 00:03:52.231
Noah fancies a quick breather. Tap his
name on court to open his menu.

00:03:55.362 --> 00:04:01.404
Choose Rest next round. Noah finishes this
match and takes the next round off.

00:04:04.187 --> 00:04:09.918
Dan needs to head home after this game.
Tap his name to open the very same menu.

00:04:12.615 --> 00:04:18.400
Choose Leave after this round. Dan can
finish his match, then head off home.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:26.951
Hugo has arrived now. Tap the Add Player
icon beside Waiting Room.

00:04:29.915 --> 00:04:34.339
Select Hugo and tap Done, so he is ready
for the next round.

00:04:38.406 --> 00:04:42.507
Once the games have finished, tap the plus
beside the round number.

00:04:45.526 --> 00:04:48.006
Tap Generate to draw Round Two.

00:04:52.457 --> 00:04:57.639
Noah is in the waiting room, Dan has
departed, and Hugo is out on court.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:02.492
By Round Three, Nina is on court for her
third match.

00:05:03.609 --> 00:05:07.324
When that game finishes, tap the round
plus once more.

00:05:11.024 --> 00:05:15.895
CourtZ reminds you that Nina has played
three games. Tick her name if she's

00:05:15.895 --> 00:05:17.035
heading off.

00:05:19.551 --> 00:05:23.043
Tap Generate to build the next round
without Nina.

00:05:28.232 --> 00:05:32.832
Noah is back in the draw, and all four
courts are ready for Round Four.

00:05:34.628 --> 00:05:40.775
Just before Round Four, Leo must take an
urgent call. Ethan can step in. Drag

00:05:40.775 --> 00:05:44.836
Ethan's name from the waiting room onto
Leo on Court One.

00:05:48.621 --> 00:05:53.833
There we are. Ethan is on court one, and
Leo is in the waiting room.

00:05:54.872 --> 00:05:59.512
Next time, simply open the very same
profile. CourtZ remembers your last

00:05:59.512 --> 00:06:03.351
attendance, so check who's arrived, and
you're all set.
